{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27795","headline":"神光寺 · 欧阳衮","name":"神光寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香刹悬青磴，飞楼界碧空。\n石门栖怖鸽，慈塔绕归鸿。\n有法将心镜，无名属性通。\n从来乐幽寂，寻觅未能穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}